WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:34.960
[The Heir]

01:35.410 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 3]

01:39.070 --> 01:42.150
I just went over
the ink workshop's ledgers.

01:42.509 --> 01:44.310
In the past two months,

01:45.170 --> 01:48.250
we've lost several more orders.

01:49.080 --> 01:51.080
I'm ashamed.

01:51.759 --> 01:54.229
I couldn't keep those master craftsmen.

01:54.590 --> 01:55.680
Jinhe,

01:56.590 --> 01:58.560
this isn't your fault.

01:58.950 --> 02:00.880
It's the rule set by our ancestors:

02:01.120 --> 02:04.000
the master craftsmen's wages
increase every year.

02:04.870 --> 02:06.120
Since we can't afford it anymore,

02:06.120 --> 02:08.310
they naturally chose to leave.

02:08.560 --> 02:10.520
Those ungrateful wretches.

02:11.120 --> 02:12.250
Have they forgotten

02:12.430 --> 02:15.150
whose hands taught them
their ink-making skills?

02:15.150 --> 02:16.230
Good riddance.

02:16.680 --> 02:19.480
Saves me the trouble
of dismissing them one by one.

02:21.050 --> 02:22.870
If those outside the family
lose their loyalty,

02:22.870 --> 02:25.400
we can simply send them packing.

02:25.960 --> 02:27.760
They can't stir up much trouble.

02:27.870 --> 02:29.840
But if even our own family
turns on itself,

02:29.840 --> 02:31.280
then we are truly finished.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.150
Jiangyue,

02:32.280 --> 02:34.079
what do you mean by that?

02:38.310 --> 02:39.120
Mother,

02:39.960 --> 02:40.960
a few days ago,

02:41.520 --> 02:44.050
when I went to the treasury
to take inventory,

02:44.360 --> 02:47.020
I found we were short
exactly 20 taels of silver.

02:47.360 --> 02:49.290
I had it investigated immediately

02:50.030 --> 02:52.470
and found
that you had withdrawn it, Wanyi,

02:52.640 --> 02:56.170
claiming it was for the dowry
of the girl from the Eighth Branch.

03:00.470 --> 03:01.310
Zhen...

03:01.800 --> 03:02.840
No matter what,

03:03.190 --> 03:05.250
she's still a daughter of our family.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.190
I heard she hasn't even found the money

03:07.190 --> 03:08.360
for the Full Phoenix Procession,

03:08.360 --> 03:10.030
so I wanted to help her a bit.

03:10.760 --> 03:11.810
And when I took the money,

03:11.810 --> 03:14.140
I wrote it down clearly
in black and white—

03:14.560 --> 03:16.420
it will be deducted
from my monthly allowance.

03:16.420 --> 03:17.980
Not a single coin from
the family's shared treasury was touched.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.950
It's not about the money, Wanyi!

03:20.310 --> 03:22.840
The Eighth Branch has already
been expelled from the clan.

03:22.840 --> 03:23.960
Their affairs

03:23.960 --> 03:26.910
have nothing to do with you
or the rest of the family!

03:26.960 --> 03:27.560
But...

03:28.280 --> 03:30.400
Don't blame Wanyi for this—

03:31.560 --> 03:34.800
I was the one who told her
to withdraw the money.

03:36.750 --> 03:40.120
We all watched Zhen grow up, right?

03:41.280 --> 03:43.340
Even if she's no longer counted as a Li

03:43.540 --> 03:45.290
but only as an adopted daughter
of an outside family,

03:45.290 --> 03:46.360
we should at least

03:46.710 --> 03:48.840
show her some kindness, shouldn't we?

03:48.840 --> 03:50.750
Aunt Rujun, by siding with them,

03:51.400 --> 03:53.190
you'll only chill the hearts
of the Sixth and Seventh Branches.

03:53.190 --> 03:53.870
Shut up!

03:56.560 --> 03:59.079
She's the mistress of the family.

03:59.500 --> 04:02.560
Does she need your permission
for everything she does?

04:03.000 --> 04:03.750
Rujun,

04:03.960 --> 04:05.000
since we’re delivering the dowry,

04:05.000 --> 04:06.400
let me take care of it.

04:07.760 --> 04:09.890
I haven't seen Jinshui in a long time.

04:10.710 --> 04:11.590
Okay.

04:15.680 --> 04:17.880
Years have passed in the blink of an eye.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.720
Now Zhen is getting married.

04:20.260 --> 04:22.510
No matter what happened back then,

04:22.830 --> 04:25.430
you're still a granddaughter
of the Li family.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.070
Your seventh grandmother

04:27.070 --> 04:29.270
and eldest aunt miss you dearly.

04:30.160 --> 04:32.720
They've asked me to bring you some dowry.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.870
It's very generous of Rujun.

04:37.600 --> 04:38.390
Zhen,

04:39.510 --> 04:40.480
accept it.

04:51.510 --> 04:53.110
How are Seventh Grandmother

04:53.220 --> 04:55.580
and you, Sixth Grandfather?

04:55.800 --> 04:56.750
We're old.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.200
Not much use anymore.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.320
It's really nice

04:59.380 --> 05:01.430
that you're still thinking of us.

05:01.750 --> 05:02.480
Jinshui,

05:02.950 --> 05:04.310
I've come today

05:04.630 --> 05:06.430
not only to deliver Zhen's dowry

05:07.000 --> 05:08.460
but also to say something.

05:10.720 --> 05:12.120
Zhen's wedding

05:12.680 --> 05:14.830
is a great joy for our whole family.

05:15.560 --> 05:16.800
As an elder,

05:17.800 --> 05:19.400
I should offer my blessings.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.800
However,

05:21.310 --> 05:23.920
regarding the marriage
between the Tian family and ours,

05:23.920 --> 05:25.720
you shouldn't get too involved.

05:25.870 --> 05:26.720
Jinhe,

05:27.560 --> 05:28.890
what do you mean by that?

05:29.190 --> 05:31.510
A girl grows up and eventually
marries into another family.

05:31.510 --> 05:34.040
Once she does,
she belongs to another family.

05:35.040 --> 05:38.100
You must not let your affection
for your granddaughter

05:38.190 --> 05:40.070
lead you to hand down all your craft

05:40.070 --> 05:41.310
to the Tian family.

05:45.000 --> 05:46.130
Sixth Grandfather,

05:46.680 --> 05:48.480
where is that coming from?

05:49.190 --> 05:51.360
Ever since our Eighth Branch
was expelled from the clan,

05:51.360 --> 05:54.070
we haven't taken a single thing
from the Li family.

05:54.070 --> 05:55.270
We didn't in the past,

05:55.360 --> 05:57.420
and we certainly won't in the future.

05:57.630 --> 05:58.830
I

05:59.680 --> 06:01.610
am not doubting your grandfather.

06:01.800 --> 06:04.430
I simply want to
make certain things clear in advance.

06:04.430 --> 06:06.600
My grandfather has been upright
all his life.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.000
Others may not know this,

06:08.360 --> 06:10.690
but don't you know it, Sixth Grandfather?

06:11.190 --> 06:14.050
I don't deserve such kindness
from the Li family...

06:14.730 --> 06:17.060
and I certainly cannot accept this dowry!

06:17.120 --> 06:20.000
Please go back and tell the main branches

06:20.410 --> 06:22.460
that even if I never get married,

06:22.560 --> 06:24.620
I will never covet anything of yours.

06:34.510 --> 06:36.310
As for the ink-making skills...

06:38.120 --> 06:39.580
I've long forgotten them.

06:42.390 --> 06:43.240
Jinhe...

06:46.750 --> 06:48.510
I still have some work to do.

06:49.530 --> 06:50.390
Excuse me.

06:56.600 --> 06:58.260
These are all your favorites.

06:58.680 --> 07:00.340
Try the peach blossom pastry.

07:01.680 --> 07:03.920
Benchang, it's only been a few days.

07:04.310 --> 07:06.240
Why do you look so worn and haggard?

07:09.040 --> 07:09.840
What's wrong?

07:10.310 --> 07:12.160
Has something happened?

07:19.040 --> 07:21.040
What happened? Don't scare me!

07:25.830 --> 07:26.680
Zhen,

07:28.310 --> 07:29.710
our family is in trouble.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.240
What happened?

07:31.920 --> 07:33.120
Some time ago,

07:34.340 --> 07:35.590
our family built a new smoke shed

07:35.590 --> 07:37.800
and began using the Luo Ink-Making Method.

07:37.800 --> 07:39.159
Now, all the lampblack we've produced

07:39.159 --> 07:40.620
has turned out defective.

07:40.950 --> 07:42.070
How could that be?

07:42.510 --> 07:45.170
We invited many master craftsmen
to examine it,

07:45.340 --> 07:47.470
but none could determine the problem.

07:48.720 --> 07:49.390
Zhen,

07:50.190 --> 07:52.390
the order I mentioned to you
before is due soon,

07:52.390 --> 07:55.050
but we won't be able to
deliver the goods on time.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.350
If we breach the contract...

07:57.480 --> 07:59.060
we'll have to pay 10 times
the amount in damages.

07:59.060 --> 08:03.390
Even selling the entire ink workshop
wouldn't be enough to cover the damages.

08:05.360 --> 08:06.290
Don't be afraid.

08:07.070 --> 08:08.000
If nothing else,

08:08.340 --> 08:10.070
I can give you my savings first.

08:10.310 --> 08:10.950
Zhen,

08:11.000 --> 08:12.260
I can't use your money.

08:13.950 --> 08:14.800
But...

08:17.190 --> 08:20.000
I want to ask your grandfather
for an ink recipe.

08:21.350 --> 08:23.120
The eldest young master
of the Luo family said

08:23.120 --> 08:24.480
that if we had that recipe,

08:24.480 --> 08:25.310
he would be willing to help us

08:25.310 --> 08:27.570
resolve the problem with our smoke shed.

08:34.630 --> 08:35.960
Ink recipes are each family's

08:35.960 --> 08:37.620
most closely guarded secret—

08:37.789 --> 08:39.919
they would never be shared so readily.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.710
Your grandfather...

08:43.960 --> 08:46.030
is no longer a member of the Li family.

08:47.120 --> 08:47.960
In principle,

08:48.030 --> 08:50.440
if he wishes to work
as a master craftsman elsewhere,

08:50.440 --> 08:52.300
there's nothing wrong with that.

08:52.750 --> 08:53.720
How about this?

08:54.100 --> 08:55.720
I'll ask my father to
draw up a letter of engagement,

08:55.720 --> 08:57.320
hiring him as head of our ink workshop...

08:57.320 --> 08:58.030
Enough!

08:58.910 --> 08:59.910
Say no more!

09:00.200 --> 09:01.630
That's absolutely impossible.

09:01.630 --> 09:02.440
Zhen,

09:02.910 --> 09:05.000
I must save our family's ink workshop.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.270
As long as the workshop stands,

09:06.270 --> 09:07.480
we'll never have to live

09:07.480 --> 09:09.140
under another's thumb again.

09:09.360 --> 09:11.290
I'll keep the promise I made to you.

09:11.390 --> 09:13.080
My grandfather once told me

09:13.480 --> 09:16.230
that everything he'd learned in his life
was for Li Ink.

09:16.230 --> 09:18.150
Even though we have been expelled
from the clan,

09:18.150 --> 09:19.870
that will never change!

09:20.150 --> 09:21.670
On every count,

09:22.150 --> 09:23.320
I cannot help you.

09:23.630 --> 09:26.160
And please, do not go trouble
my grandfather.

09:26.270 --> 09:27.150
Zhen,

09:27.650 --> 09:28.550
I've never intended to put him

09:28.550 --> 09:31.150
in a difficult position
when I ask for his help.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.750
I really have no other choice.

09:32.750 --> 09:33.960
We are getting married

09:33.960 --> 09:35.910
because we love each other.

09:36.790 --> 09:38.250
I don't want anything else

09:38.270 --> 09:39.910
to be mixed into it.

09:41.790 --> 09:42.550
Benchang,

09:43.830 --> 09:45.910
I've never coveted
any of your family's property

09:45.910 --> 09:47.670
or the ink workshop.

09:48.480 --> 09:50.280
I'm marrying you for who you are.

09:50.600 --> 09:52.150
I hope you feel the same!

09:52.480 --> 09:53.360
Zhen,

09:53.750 --> 09:55.880
my love for you is true and clear as day.

09:57.960 --> 09:58.910
All these years,

10:00.440 --> 10:03.840
we've never schemed to gain anything
from your grandfather.

10:05.750 --> 10:06.600
This time...

10:07.270 --> 10:09.000
This time, I was just anxious,

10:09.290 --> 10:10.720
so I spoke nonsense.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.630
Don't be mad at me.

10:11.630 --> 10:13.230
You have to believe me, Zhen.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.790
Of course, I believe you.

10:18.960 --> 10:21.770
If we truly end up
having to pay damages for that order,

10:21.770 --> 10:23.800
I'll face it with you.

10:26.480 --> 10:28.140
How about I take it upon myself

10:28.200 --> 10:29.930
and give you the money my family

10:30.080 --> 10:31.280
saved up for me first?

10:31.750 --> 10:32.810
Anyway, Benchang,

10:32.960 --> 10:34.360
my mother used to say that

10:34.440 --> 10:36.200
as long as you stand tall,

10:36.200 --> 10:37.960
grit your teeth, and keep moving,

10:37.960 --> 10:40.020
there's nothing you can’t overcome!

10:40.270 --> 10:41.480
You're right, Zhen.

10:42.600 --> 10:44.060
It's just some lampblack.

10:44.550 --> 10:46.000
I'll find another way.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.480
I said it before—

10:50.080 --> 10:52.150
we must never try to
get anything out of Eighth Master Li.

10:52.150 --> 10:53.810
Now look at what has come of it.

10:54.000 --> 10:55.480
Zhen is upset with me because of this.

10:55.480 --> 10:57.320
Father, are you satisfied?

10:58.600 --> 10:59.960
We caused this trouble,

11:01.120 --> 11:02.520
so we solve it ourselves.

11:08.510 --> 11:10.240
Since the Li family won't help,

11:10.440 --> 11:11.900
let's go to the Luo family.

11:12.480 --> 11:13.270
You and I

11:13.390 --> 11:15.480
will kneel before Eldest Young Master Luo

11:15.480 --> 11:16.910
until he agrees!

11:16.910 --> 11:17.720
I won't go!

11:19.270 --> 11:20.270
I'll go try again!

11:21.210 --> 11:22.670
Even if it costs me my life,

11:22.960 --> 11:24.620
I'll produce that lampblack!

11:25.510 --> 11:27.270
-Benchang!
-You bastard!

11:32.110 --> 11:33.600
In-laws,

11:34.030 --> 11:36.030
you called me here in such a hurry.

11:36.570 --> 11:38.370
Has something urgent happened?

11:38.680 --> 11:40.250
H-Have some water first.

11:44.000 --> 11:45.060
Thank you, in-law.

11:50.130 --> 11:51.680
Why are you crying?

11:52.480 --> 11:53.670
Just say it!

11:53.670 --> 11:55.330
Crying won't solve anything!

11:55.360 --> 11:56.270
In-law,

11:56.960 --> 11:58.270
what happened exactly?

11:58.270 --> 11:59.320
Please tell me.

11:59.720 --> 12:02.390
In-law, this may sound embarrassing,

12:04.840 --> 12:06.320
but you also know our Tian family

12:06.320 --> 12:08.650
used to be bondservants to the Luo family.

12:08.840 --> 12:10.770
When Old Master Luo was still here,

12:10.870 --> 12:12.730
he treated us with some courtesy.

12:12.750 --> 12:13.600
But now

12:13.960 --> 12:15.030
he resides in the capital

12:15.030 --> 12:16.390
and rarely comes back.

12:16.440 --> 12:19.710
It just so happens that Luo Wensong is
in charge of the household now.

12:19.710 --> 12:22.760
He orders us around all the time

12:22.780 --> 12:24.980
without showing us an ounce of respect.

12:25.240 --> 12:26.600
Recently,

12:26.670 --> 12:29.670
he got hold of a piece
of thousand-year-old pine soot.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.670
He failed to produce ink from it,

12:31.910 --> 12:33.750
so he's used the large order
our family just took on

12:33.750 --> 12:35.480
to threaten us.

12:35.720 --> 12:37.510
He's forcing my husband...

12:38.440 --> 12:39.670
forcing him...

12:40.240 --> 12:41.750
He's forcing us

12:42.480 --> 12:43.750
to ask for...

12:44.970 --> 12:46.900
the ink recipe from your Li family.

13:09.470 --> 13:10.560
Jingfu...

13:12.480 --> 13:14.240
Master Tian came to me.

13:15.970 --> 13:18.770
He said they need the ink recipe
from the Li family.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.920
If we don't give it to them...

13:23.670 --> 13:25.670
they might call off the engagement.

13:26.750 --> 13:28.950
But how could I possibly give it to them?

13:29.590 --> 13:30.990
For Father's sake alone,

13:31.080 --> 13:32.510
I could never agree to it—

13:33.390 --> 13:35.720
nor can I mention a word of it to him.

13:37.480 --> 13:39.010
I hesitated for a long time.

13:39.480 --> 13:41.200
I was prepared to risk everything

13:41.200 --> 13:43.800
and go ask Aunt Rujun
for a copy of their recipe.

13:44.600 --> 13:46.840
She is a reasonable person.

13:48.240 --> 13:50.030
But my mind...

13:52.390 --> 13:55.540
is filled with the image of you
as you left this world.

13:57.550 --> 13:58.620
Jingfu...

14:00.270 --> 14:01.960
Tell me, what should I do?

14:14.870 --> 14:15.630
Benchang,

14:16.390 --> 14:17.320
stop trying.

14:18.200 --> 14:20.630
Our family doesn't really
have much experience with ink-making.

14:20.630 --> 14:22.090
How much skill can we have?

14:22.600 --> 14:24.270
No matter how many more days and nights
you toil over this,

14:24.190 --> 14:26.620
[Tian Bensheng,
Second Son of the Tian Family]

14:24.270 --> 14:27.000
you can't match what others have inherited
through generations.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.240
Luo Wensong is developing new ink,

14:28.240 --> 14:29.720
so you do the same.

14:29.720 --> 14:31.360
Aren't you just...

14:35.390 --> 14:36.030
Benchang,

14:36.750 --> 14:38.550
I know what you're thinking.

14:39.120 --> 14:40.720
You just want people to know

14:40.790 --> 14:42.390
that, besides Luo Wensong,

14:42.390 --> 14:44.720
there's also a man
named Tian Benchang in Huizhou.

14:44.720 --> 14:45.440
What a shame.

14:45.440 --> 14:47.240
Now, not only is the business failing,

14:47.240 --> 14:48.870
but you've managed to lose a bride
who was practically already yours—

14:48.870 --> 14:50.790
all through your own recklessness.
Isn't it?

14:50.790 --> 14:51.720
What did you say?

14:51.750 --> 14:52.840
You didn't know?

14:53.720 --> 14:55.930
Father and Mother
put their foot down today.

14:55.930 --> 14:57.470
If the Li family doesn't give us
the ink recipe,

14:57.470 --> 14:59.150
our family will call off the engagement.

14:59.150 --> 15:00.270
But guess what?

15:00.840 --> 15:03.440
Your future mother-in-law
didn't budge an inch.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.840
I'm going to ask Father and Mother.

15:04.840 --> 15:05.440
Benchang!

15:06.360 --> 15:07.870
Father and Mother's meaning is clear:

15:07.870 --> 15:08.910
if we get the ink recipe,

15:08.910 --> 15:10.830
our family will happily welcome the bride.

15:10.830 --> 15:12.040
Without it,

15:12.070 --> 15:13.670
Zhen can forget about
getting into the bridal sedan!

15:13.670 --> 15:15.390
How could they make things hard for Zhen?

15:15.390 --> 15:17.450
Once she marries in, she'll be a Tian!

15:17.480 --> 15:18.480
When our family faces hardship,

15:18.480 --> 15:20.140
how can she just stay out of it?

15:22.030 --> 15:23.690
Feeling protective, are you?

15:25.390 --> 15:26.320
My dear brother,

15:26.880 --> 15:28.080
if you want to shield her,

15:28.080 --> 15:30.150
you must have the ability to do so.

15:30.240 --> 15:31.170
Don't you think?

15:32.030 --> 15:34.030
Benchang, think it over carefully.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.030
One, two, three.

15:51.320 --> 15:52.120
Zhengliang.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.480
I swear to Heaven.

15:58.360 --> 15:59.750
I only just learned of

16:00.270 --> 16:03.440
my parents' intentions myself.

16:04.030 --> 16:07.230
If I ever had the thought of
calling off the engagement...

16:09.200 --> 16:10.670
may Heaven and Earth strike me down.

16:10.670 --> 16:12.070
I don't want to hear this!

16:12.480 --> 16:14.140
I'm only asking you one thing—

16:14.550 --> 16:16.410
are you going to marry Zhen or not?

16:16.630 --> 16:17.870
I, Tian Benchang,

16:19.670 --> 16:21.330
in this life and this world...

16:23.240 --> 16:24.550
will marry no one but Zhen!

16:24.550 --> 16:26.280
Then go tell your parents that!

16:26.870 --> 16:28.400
When all is said and done...

16:29.870 --> 16:30.930
the whole thing...

16:34.750 --> 16:35.870
was my fault.

16:38.360 --> 16:40.020
If I hadn't been impatient...

16:42.320 --> 16:45.720
and overestimated myself
by taking on that difficult order,

16:45.720 --> 16:47.390
we'd never have been
held over a barrel by the Luo family.

16:47.390 --> 16:49.600
I know Zhen is filial.

16:49.630 --> 16:51.270
I know Eighth Master Li
is a man of integrity!

16:51.270 --> 16:53.400
I know that in Huizhou's ink industry,

16:53.400 --> 16:56.380
every family guards their ink recipes
as tightly as their lives—

16:56.380 --> 16:57.630
they would never lend them out.

16:57.630 --> 16:58.270
I...

16:59.840 --> 17:01.390
I know all of that.

17:02.390 --> 17:03.200
But...

17:06.920 --> 17:09.109
without that ink recipe...

17:12.550 --> 17:15.480
my family will lose absolutely everything.

17:18.589 --> 17:20.589
Even if Zhen marries me...

17:23.200 --> 17:25.460
she'll have to suffer in poverty with me.

17:26.069 --> 17:27.349
For Zhen...

17:30.030 --> 17:31.510
I'm willing to

17:32.920 --> 17:34.070
do anything.

18:02.310 --> 18:03.160
Come on.

18:04.190 --> 18:05.190
Eat slowly.

18:05.220 --> 18:06.160
Don't choke yourself.

18:06.160 --> 18:07.620
Here, have some porridge.

18:09.680 --> 18:11.240
I'll be getting married in a few days.

18:11.240 --> 18:13.640
I won't be able to
eat your cooking anymore, Mother.

18:13.640 --> 18:15.720
You're not marrying off
to the ends of the earth.

18:15.720 --> 18:17.880
The Tian household is
just a few steps away from ours.

18:17.880 --> 18:19.200
Just come back often.

18:19.550 --> 18:20.720
That won't be the same.

18:20.720 --> 18:22.750
In the future, the person I see
when I wake up every morning

18:22.750 --> 18:24.410
won't be you anymore, Mother.

18:27.200 --> 18:28.240
What if...

18:29.960 --> 18:31.690
I don't want you to get married?

18:36.420 --> 18:37.820
Then I won't get married.

18:38.270 --> 18:40.200
Ronghua isn't married yet anyway,

18:40.200 --> 18:42.070
and Benchang will always be there.

18:42.070 --> 18:43.400
I'll just stay by your side forever.

18:43.400 --> 18:44.070
Mother!

18:44.510 --> 18:45.960
Come give me a hand!

18:47.240 --> 18:47.830
Come on!

18:48.070 --> 18:49.130
Here, give it to me.

18:49.830 --> 18:50.400
Give me.

18:51.240 --> 18:51.970
Zhengliang.

18:52.550 --> 18:53.880
Didn't I tell you?

18:54.200 --> 18:56.530
Benchang's family ran into some trouble,

18:56.920 --> 18:59.160
so the wedding was going to
be kept simple.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.720
I just ran into Benchang.

19:00.880 --> 19:03.160
He said his family's matter
has all been sorted out!

19:03.160 --> 19:03.960
Really?

19:04.000 --> 19:04.720
Really!

19:05.080 --> 19:06.210
He said Luo Wensong

19:06.240 --> 19:07.480
received a letter from Old Master Luo

19:07.480 --> 19:08.540
and agreed to help!

19:10.590 --> 19:11.650
That's wonderful!

19:13.440 --> 19:15.110
Benchang has been so worried about this

19:15.110 --> 19:16.270
for days.

19:16.590 --> 19:18.030
Now it's finally settled.

19:18.030 --> 19:19.070
Our Zhen

19:19.160 --> 19:20.400
must have a grand wedding!

19:20.400 --> 19:21.200
That's right!

19:21.640 --> 19:22.550
Our Zhen

19:22.830 --> 19:24.310
must marry in style!

19:25.110 --> 19:26.910
Come on, let's go put these away.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.460
I'll take it. Give it to me.

19:30.880 --> 19:32.010
Mother, it's heavy.

19:32.110 --> 19:33.000
How wonderful.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.350
Thank you.

20:06.440 --> 20:08.500
I, Zhen, bid farewell to Grandfather

20:08.640 --> 20:09.510
and to Mother.

20:21.960 --> 20:22.830
I also

20:23.240 --> 20:24.480
wish you both

20:25.240 --> 20:26.640
a lifetime of happiness,

20:27.880 --> 20:29.140
growing old together.

20:31.480 --> 20:33.160
Lift the sedan!

20:50.160 --> 20:51.030
Here!

20:51.270 --> 20:54.480
When a woman accepts wedding sweets,
prosperity follows!

20:54.480 --> 20:55.270
Thank you.

20:56.880 --> 20:57.680
Thank you.

21:51.750 --> 21:52.830
Stop!

21:53.880 --> 21:54.790
Thank you.

22:08.350 --> 22:09.240
Uncle Jingdong,

22:09.240 --> 22:11.030
today is the joyous occasion
of my wedding to Zhen.

22:11.030 --> 22:12.400
What is the meaning of this?

22:12.400 --> 22:15.510
Your family certainly knows
how to play a clever game.

22:15.590 --> 22:18.070
You want to use this marriage
with the Eighth Branch

22:18.070 --> 22:20.160
to steal our family's ink recipe.

22:20.280 --> 22:24.010
You've truly gone to great lengths,
scheming every step of the way.

22:24.550 --> 22:26.350
But, boy of the Tian family,

22:26.830 --> 22:27.920
listen up,

22:29.640 --> 22:31.750
no human plan can overcome Heaven's will.

22:31.750 --> 22:34.070
I, Li Jingdong,
am putting my foot down here—

22:34.070 --> 22:36.670
if you don't hand over
our family's ink recipe,

22:36.790 --> 22:38.440
this wedding of yours

22:38.750 --> 22:40.200
won't go through!

22:41.350 --> 22:42.410
Uncle Jingdong...

22:43.720 --> 22:45.270
I don't know what you're talking about.

22:45.270 --> 22:48.480
Bring forth the Founder's Black Banner!

23:12.070 --> 23:15.900
[Hu Shunlin,
President of Literary Association]

23:12.160 --> 23:13.690
The Founder's Black Banner

23:13.930 --> 23:16.400
cannot be moved
unless it's an extreme emergency!

23:16.400 --> 23:17.240
Li Jingdong,

23:17.510 --> 23:19.750
you've gone to the extreme
of bringing out the Black Banner—

23:19.750 --> 23:21.150
what are you trying to do?

23:26.510 --> 23:27.310
Excuse me.

23:28.480 --> 23:29.830
This is no small matter.

23:30.030 --> 23:31.200
You must not speak recklessly.

23:31.200 --> 23:31.720
Excuse me.

23:31.720 --> 23:33.160
Whether I am speaking nonsense or not...

23:33.160 --> 23:33.590
Zhen.

23:33.590 --> 23:35.200
Third Master Chen, you shall soon see.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.160
What's going on?

23:37.110 --> 23:37.960
Li Jingdong,

23:38.110 --> 23:39.160
what do you want?

23:40.240 --> 23:40.960
Zhen,

23:41.310 --> 23:42.030
I don't know

23:42.030 --> 23:43.310
what they are talking about either.

23:43.310 --> 23:44.510
Boy of the Tian family,

23:44.510 --> 23:46.270
you dare say you don't know?

23:46.640 --> 23:48.500
Without our family's ink recipe,

23:48.720 --> 23:52.440
would Luo Wensong ever help your family?

23:53.270 --> 23:54.800
The Li family's ink recipe?

23:54.950 --> 23:55.950
What ink recipe?

23:56.240 --> 23:57.750
Zhen, don't listen to him.

23:58.880 --> 23:59.810
Uncle Jingdong,

23:59.830 --> 24:01.400
what nonsense are you talking about?

24:01.400 --> 24:02.240
Li Jingdong,

24:02.750 --> 24:04.160
you have no proof.

24:04.490 --> 24:05.820
How dare you wrongly accuse us?

24:05.820 --> 24:08.580
The proof is right inside your dowry.

24:09.480 --> 24:11.030
You're making baseless accusations!

24:11.030 --> 24:11.590
Mother!

24:12.030 --> 24:13.290
Mother, Grandfather!

24:14.070 --> 24:15.160
Why are you here?

24:15.270 --> 24:16.000
Li Jingdong,

24:16.350 --> 24:17.640
you are talking nonsense.

24:17.640 --> 24:19.640
When have we ever stolen
your family's ink recipe?

24:19.640 --> 24:20.640
Eighth Master Li,

24:20.880 --> 24:23.880
do you dare swear
before the Founder's Black Banner

24:24.030 --> 24:25.720
that inside Zhen's dowry,

24:25.720 --> 24:27.440
there is no Li family's ink recipe?

24:27.440 --> 24:28.750
Do you dare?

24:37.480 --> 24:38.640
I, Li Jinshui,

24:39.070 --> 24:41.530
have made ink-making
the calling of my life.

24:41.920 --> 24:43.240
Even though

24:43.750 --> 24:45.280
I haven't made ink in years,

24:45.880 --> 24:47.280
the rules of the ink trade

24:47.920 --> 24:49.520
remain engraved in my heart.

24:50.270 --> 24:51.240
I have not,

24:51.680 --> 24:52.920
nor could I ever...

24:55.750 --> 24:58.310
leak the Li family's recipe to outsiders.

24:58.310 --> 25:01.880
Eighth Master Li,
nothing stays hidden forever.

25:02.880 --> 25:04.960
The Luos demanded our family's recipe

25:04.960 --> 25:07.000
in exchange for saving
the Tian family's business.

25:07.000 --> 25:10.200
I've thoroughly and carefully
investigated all of this.

25:10.350 --> 25:12.480
And yet you still deny it?

25:12.510 --> 25:14.240
That's not true, Eighth Master Li.

25:14.240 --> 25:15.370
Don't listen to him.

25:16.030 --> 25:18.590
Grandfather, he's just spouting nonsense.

25:19.030 --> 25:20.430
Whether it's true or not,

25:21.750 --> 25:23.480
a search of the dowry will tell.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.480
Men!

25:25.920 --> 25:27.110
Search it!

25:28.240 --> 25:28.970
You must not!

25:29.270 --> 25:30.270
You cannot search the dowry.

25:30.270 --> 25:31.070
Benchang!

25:31.440 --> 25:33.400
Don't stop them. Let them search!

25:33.790 --> 25:34.960
I'd like to see

25:35.000 --> 25:36.530
what exactly they can find!

25:36.640 --> 25:37.510
Jingdong!

25:40.480 --> 25:41.740
Seventh Grandmother.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.270
Jingdong,

25:45.440 --> 25:46.880
even if there is an issue,

25:48.270 --> 25:50.640
it should be resolved within our family.

25:51.070 --> 25:52.880
Making a scene in public

25:53.400 --> 25:55.960
only brings shame on our own family!

25:55.960 --> 25:56.880
Aunt Rujun,

25:58.350 --> 26:00.880
everything I do
is for our family's business.

26:02.000 --> 26:03.960
I have a clear conscience.

26:04.750 --> 26:07.720
If I have wronged Eighth Master Li today,

26:08.200 --> 26:10.330
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.960
But if the Eighth Branch

26:12.960 --> 26:15.160
has really leaked our family's recipe,

26:15.720 --> 26:17.270
then I ask the Eighth Branch

26:18.200 --> 26:21.070
to give us an accounting

26:21.640 --> 26:23.550
before the Black Banner.

26:24.960 --> 26:28.400
It doesn't have to come to this, Jingdong.

26:40.720 --> 26:41.590
Seventh Aunt,

26:42.310 --> 26:43.770
for the sake of our family,

26:44.240 --> 26:46.440
please indulge me this once!

26:54.920 --> 26:56.400
Found it! Found it!

27:28.200 --> 27:30.160
How do you explain this?

27:33.880 --> 27:34.790
It was me!

27:36.200 --> 27:38.240
I, Li Zhengliang,
was disloyal and unfilial

27:38.240 --> 27:40.030
and stole the ink recipe
for the Tian family!

27:40.030 --> 27:41.110
It's

27:41.270 --> 27:42.830
all my fault!

27:43.110 --> 27:44.200
None of this has anything to do with

27:44.200 --> 27:46.240
my grandfather, my mother, or Zhen!

27:47.510 --> 27:48.370
Zhengliang...

27:49.880 --> 27:50.960
Do you know

27:51.510 --> 27:52.640
what you are saying?

27:53.110 --> 27:54.960
Zhengliang, what on earth happened?

27:54.960 --> 27:55.680
What happened?

27:55.680 --> 27:56.830
Hurry up and tell us!

27:58.920 --> 28:00.350
Say something!

28:02.270 --> 28:03.270
Benchang said...

28:04.350 --> 28:07.080
the ink recipe
concerned his family's survival.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.680
If we didn't give it to them,

28:09.680 --> 28:12.440
you'd endure hardship with the Tian family
for the rest of your life.

28:12.440 --> 28:13.400
It was my fault.

28:13.830 --> 28:15.630
I couldn't think of another way.

28:18.870 --> 28:20.560
You... you foolish child!

28:20.590 --> 28:21.240
How could you...

28:21.240 --> 28:23.350
How could you do such a stupid thing?

28:23.370 --> 28:24.310
Don't you know

28:24.310 --> 28:26.550
you've ruined Zhen!

28:27.240 --> 28:28.100
It was my fault.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.650
It was all my fault.

28:52.590 --> 28:53.680
Zhengliang...

28:54.270 --> 28:55.070
Eighth Uncle,

28:55.880 --> 28:58.010
of the four brothers in my generation,

28:58.240 --> 29:00.750
I'm the only one left breathing

29:01.070 --> 29:04.240
with just one leg—crippled though I am.

29:04.480 --> 29:05.640
You once said

29:05.970 --> 29:09.440
that it was the Li family's support
that allowed you to master your craft

29:09.440 --> 29:11.200
and that you would repay them in kind—

29:11.200 --> 29:14.070
that you'd never do anything
to shame our ancestors!

29:14.070 --> 29:14.920
But...

29:16.070 --> 29:17.730
what about your descendants?

29:18.880 --> 29:19.960
Today...

29:20.720 --> 29:23.000
before the Founder's Black Banner,

29:23.680 --> 29:25.510
give us an account!

29:35.000 --> 29:35.930
Grandfather...

30:10.960 --> 30:12.310
Founder above,

30:13.550 --> 30:14.680
I, Li Jinshui,

30:15.350 --> 30:17.350
have failed to discipline my family

30:18.110 --> 30:20.720
and nearly allowed
the Li family’s ink recipe

30:21.510 --> 30:23.510
to fall into the hands of outsiders.

30:24.960 --> 30:26.420
I have failed the Li family

30:26.920 --> 30:28.270
and their ancestors.

30:31.000 --> 30:33.130
I, Li Jinshui, your devoted disciple,

30:33.550 --> 30:35.000
swear here and now:

30:36.440 --> 30:38.040
from this moment forward...

30:40.590 --> 30:43.920
from this moment forward,
I'll step away from the ink trade.

30:45.000 --> 30:46.590
If I break this oath...

30:48.440 --> 30:49.270
may I suffer

30:50.270 --> 30:51.590
eternal torment

30:52.830 --> 30:53.960
in the deepest hell.

31:02.030 --> 31:02.880
Founder,

31:03.640 --> 31:04.700
I need to borrow...

31:06.480 --> 31:08.070
your Original Ink Stick.

31:13.590 --> 31:15.000
-Grandfather!
-Grandfather!

31:15.000 --> 31:16.030
Father!

31:17.030 --> 31:18.000
Grandfather!

31:19.510 --> 31:20.350
Grandfather!

31:20.350 --> 31:21.070
Father!

31:21.070 --> 31:21.830
Grandfather!

31:21.830 --> 31:22.480
Father!

31:22.790 --> 31:23.720
Grandfather!

31:23.880 --> 31:24.510
Father!

31:33.160 --> 31:33.830
Father...

32:08.480 --> 32:09.410
Grandfather...

32:15.270 --> 32:16.160
This is...

32:18.590 --> 32:20.640
how I answer to the Li family.

32:25.790 --> 32:26.070
Father...

32:26.070 --> 32:27.000
Grandfather...

32:28.550 --> 32:29.270
Zhen,

32:29.640 --> 32:30.640
the auspicious hour is upon us...

32:30.640 --> 32:31.830
Shut up!

32:33.440 --> 32:35.160
Grandfather, please get up.

32:37.960 --> 32:38.890
Grandfather...

32:39.510 --> 32:40.440
Grandfather...

32:41.270 --> 32:41.960
Zhen...

32:43.110 --> 32:43.640
Does it hurt?

32:43.640 --> 32:45.070
I never thought things

32:45.200 --> 32:46.640
would come to this.

32:46.960 --> 32:48.160
Zhen, I did all this

32:48.310 --> 32:50.350
so we could have a good life.

32:50.590 --> 32:52.110
I truly love you, Zhen!

32:52.240 --> 32:53.350
You have to believe me, Zhen!

32:53.350 --> 32:54.440
Shut up!

32:59.350 --> 33:00.440
Tian Benchang,

33:01.030 --> 33:03.000
we grew up together.

33:03.790 --> 33:05.520
We were childhood sweethearts

33:05.880 --> 33:07.270
and deeply in love.

33:08.790 --> 33:10.390
You cared for me in every way.

33:11.590 --> 33:13.520
Between us, there was not only love

33:14.160 --> 33:15.490
but a debt of gratitude.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.240
You used to be

33:20.550 --> 33:22.240
the person I trusted most.

33:23.000 --> 33:24.070
But today,

33:24.960 --> 33:26.680
you've destroyed all of that.

33:28.310 --> 33:29.400
I told you,

33:31.000 --> 33:32.960
my family is where I draw the line.

33:34.550 --> 33:35.720
So, Benchang,

33:38.200 --> 33:39.110
this is...

33:42.480 --> 33:44.070
the end for us.

33:58.480 --> 34:01.140
Since my marriage
began with this ink recipe...

34:02.640 --> 34:04.300
let it end with the ink recipe.

34:05.200 --> 34:06.400
Everything ends now!

34:19.070 --> 34:20.400
Fellow townsfolk here,

34:20.710 --> 34:22.760
please bear witness for me, Li Zhen:

34:23.760 --> 34:25.620
the dissolution of this marriage

34:26.030 --> 34:28.560
is not because the Tian family
refuses to wed—

34:28.630 --> 34:30.690
it is I, Li Zhen, who am calling it off!

34:31.000 --> 34:32.550
Today, I, Li Zhen,

34:33.190 --> 34:35.190
am calling off this marriage!

34:35.590 --> 34:36.590
Zhen!

34:40.320 --> 34:40.880
Zhen...

34:40.920 --> 34:41.719
Grandfather!

34:43.190 --> 34:43.880
Mother.

34:45.280 --> 34:46.010
Zhengliang.

34:47.630 --> 34:48.710
Let's go home!

34:55.840 --> 34:56.710
Let's go home!

34:56.710 --> 34:57.550
Zhen...

34:58.670 --> 34:59.590
Zhen!

35:00.230 --> 35:01.320
Zhen!

35:59.710 --> 36:01.480
Young Master! Young Master!

36:01.840 --> 36:02.640
Young Master!

36:03.000 --> 36:04.000
Out with it.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.400
Li Zhen...

36:06.630 --> 36:08.360
Li Zhen called off the wedding!

36:09.400 --> 36:11.400
T-That ink recipe was torn up too!

36:22.400 --> 36:23.400
Interesting.

36:24.840 --> 36:25.770
What do you mean?

36:27.760 --> 36:30.490
I've spent years
carefully working toward this!

36:32.920 --> 36:35.030
We were just one step away!

36:35.800 --> 36:37.660
Once Zhen married into our family

36:37.840 --> 36:39.480
and we obtained
the Li family's ink recipe,

36:39.480 --> 36:40.710
we would've secured our footing

36:40.710 --> 36:42.480
in the ink trade!

36:43.670 --> 36:45.150
That scoundrel Jingdong—

36:45.480 --> 36:47.140
how did he come to know of this?

36:47.590 --> 36:48.510
And Zhen,

36:48.830 --> 36:50.190
that little girl has some nerve!

36:50.190 --> 36:51.880
She dared to call off
the wedding in public?

36:51.880 --> 36:53.110
How will our family

36:53.580 --> 36:55.350
show our faces in the future?

36:56.400 --> 36:58.360
Fortunately, Eldest Young Master Luo

36:58.360 --> 37:01.400
stepped in and took over the deal
with Registrar Zhang himself.

37:01.400 --> 37:02.230
Otherwise,

37:02.400 --> 37:05.130
we would've lost everything
and gained nothing.

37:05.630 --> 37:07.440
What do you know,

37:08.190 --> 37:09.480
short-sighted woman?

37:11.280 --> 37:12.440
Do you really think

37:12.590 --> 37:13.670
Luo Wensong

37:13.960 --> 37:15.400
suddenly grew a conscience

37:15.400 --> 37:17.060
and helped us out of kindness?

37:17.480 --> 37:18.440
Wrong!

37:19.150 --> 37:20.070
He did it

37:20.190 --> 37:22.110
to cut off all our options!

37:22.590 --> 37:23.840
Once this gets out,

37:24.110 --> 37:26.510
won't it make our family look incompetent—

37:26.840 --> 37:30.590
that we can only get things done
with the help of the Li and Luo families?

37:30.590 --> 37:32.070
Then, in all of Huizhou,

37:32.230 --> 37:34.030
who will still trust our family?

37:34.070 --> 37:35.070
In the future,

37:35.440 --> 37:37.370
who would dare do business with us?

37:38.110 --> 37:39.110
Stop right there!

37:40.840 --> 37:42.360
Well, this is your own home,

37:42.360 --> 37:44.620
and you're sneaking around like a thief!

37:45.000 --> 37:46.670
You disgraceful thing!

37:50.190 --> 37:50.920
Mother.

37:53.110 --> 37:55.360
You barely ate tonight.

37:56.840 --> 37:58.550
Please have some of this broth.

37:58.550 --> 38:00.010
Your health is important.

38:01.800 --> 38:03.590
In the end, Zhen's marriage

38:04.960 --> 38:07.630
still fell through.

38:08.800 --> 38:09.630
Yes.

38:10.920 --> 38:12.840
After the huge scene today,

38:13.920 --> 38:15.320
I'm afraid it will be hard

38:15.400 --> 38:17.710
for Zhen to marry in the future.

38:17.840 --> 38:19.590
With that girl's temperament,

38:20.190 --> 38:22.360
she may not care about that.

38:23.030 --> 38:26.150
But with Jingdong making such a scene,

38:26.320 --> 38:27.230
I'm afraid

38:28.840 --> 38:30.800
they will really

38:31.320 --> 38:32.960
sever all ties with us.

38:35.630 --> 38:38.590
All that money spent on
wedding preparations

38:38.800 --> 38:40.350
went to waste for nothing.

38:41.480 --> 38:43.880
Without the Tian family's help,

38:44.630 --> 38:45.830
life will be very hard

38:46.360 --> 38:47.840
for the Eighth Branch

38:48.190 --> 38:49.670
in the future.

38:51.400 --> 38:52.280
Let's do this:

38:52.400 --> 38:54.530
whatever Jinshui makes in the future,

38:54.920 --> 38:56.050
tell them to procure

38:56.190 --> 38:57.480
more of it.

39:05.190 --> 39:07.280
It was supposed to be
such a joyous wedding.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.320
And she was marrying into the Tian family—

39:08.320 --> 39:10.320
a family with standing and means.

39:10.760 --> 39:13.230
So many families here in City Gate Lane

39:13.230 --> 39:15.110
envy such good fortune.

39:15.440 --> 39:17.280
Exactly. Breaking off
the wedding in public...

39:17.280 --> 39:18.550
Is that girl stupid?

39:19.440 --> 39:21.030
What will she do now?

39:25.150 --> 39:27.110
Mother, Zhengliang, stop working!

39:27.110 --> 39:28.480
Zhen, where have you been?

39:28.480 --> 39:30.320
Let's have an extra dish today!

39:34.960 --> 39:35.760
Zhen.

39:36.840 --> 39:38.100
Where did you get this?

39:38.480 --> 39:40.860
Uncle Zhang at the butcher shop
practically gave it to me.

39:40.860 --> 39:41.980
Butcher Zhang

39:42.000 --> 39:43.400
is usually so tight-fisted,

39:43.400 --> 39:45.230
but he can't stand to see a woman cry.

39:45.230 --> 39:47.000
So I put on a show for him.

39:47.110 --> 39:47.960
I said,

39:48.630 --> 39:52.590
"Uncle Zhang,
with such misfortune befalling our family,

39:53.060 --> 39:54.660
my mother and grandfather

39:54.690 --> 39:56.610
can hardly eat."

39:56.800 --> 39:58.000
And guess what?

39:58.190 --> 40:00.510
He sold me all this for just five coins!

40:00.840 --> 40:03.240
Uncle Zhang even gave me
a lot of pork belly.

40:03.590 --> 40:05.960
He said that since Grandfather's teeth
weren't good,

40:05.960 --> 40:08.000
he shouldn't risk chewing on bones.

40:10.400 --> 40:11.230
Oh, you.

40:11.550 --> 40:13.070
They gossip about me behind my back
all the time.

40:13.070 --> 40:14.360
I can't shut them up,

40:14.480 --> 40:16.360
so I might as well
get something out of it.

40:16.360 --> 40:18.090
That way, it's not a total loss.

40:21.710 --> 40:23.110
I'm not blaming you.

40:24.530 --> 40:26.060
-I’m just afraid…
-Mother.

40:26.170 --> 40:27.090
I know.

40:27.590 --> 40:28.590
I know all that.

40:29.880 --> 40:31.800
But I was the one
who called off the wedding.

40:31.800 --> 40:33.330
It's not worth regretting.

40:33.360 --> 40:35.190
And it's certainly not worth
letting you, Grandfather,

40:35.190 --> 40:36.850
and my brother feel bad for me.

40:38.190 --> 40:40.630
I went to the Li family
on Grandfather's behalf

40:40.630 --> 40:43.190
and returned the manuscript
we had taken this morning.

40:43.190 --> 40:44.450
From this day forward,

40:44.630 --> 40:46.960
we have absolutely nothing to do
with the Li family

40:46.960 --> 40:48.190
or the Tian family.

40:49.030 --> 40:50.760
In City Gate Lane, the Li family

40:50.840 --> 40:52.360
means only the four of us!

40:52.760 --> 40:54.110
Let's eat well

40:54.440 --> 40:55.770
and live our lives well!

41:01.670 --> 41:03.330
That's easier said than done.

41:04.510 --> 41:06.550
Mother, I'm starving.

41:06.550 --> 41:08.960
Hurry up and make me some bone broth.

41:09.480 --> 41:10.550
Go on. Go.

41:10.800 --> 41:11.800
Fine.

41:12.760 --> 41:14.560
I'll go stew it for you right now.

41:35.800 --> 41:36.480
Grandfather.
